3. Editorial content authored by this project
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * `web/place-menus.js` — 招牌菜 lists are written by this project. Dish names
    and preparation notes only; no prices, no set menus. Not sourced from Amap,
    美团 or 点评.
  * The 长春地标 / 长春名吃 badges are editorial tags maintained by hand in
    `scripts/build_places.py`.
  * Queue time ranges are estimates drawn from two narrow constants
    (`confidence: "低"`). No venue supplies them and no queue feed is connected;
    every card that shows one is labelled 参考等候 · 非实时.

